      <description>&lt;h2&gt;Agent Gauge 0.1.6&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;A new app icon.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Download as a disk image: open it and drag Agent Gauge to Applications.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Offers to move itself to Applications when opened from somewhere else, so updates keep working.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Fable limit refreshes when you open the Claude popover, and background checks use far less CPU.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;An old Fable reading is hidden after 30 minutes of failed reads instead of looking fresh.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Connecting Claude Code works when your home folder&amp;#x27;s name has spaces.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/joargp/agent-gauge/releases/tag/v0.1.6"&gt;Release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
